Description: Wild OS PDF
 PDF reads, fills in and signs PDF files, on Poppler, the engine Okular and
 Evince draw with. Highlight text, draw and type on pages, fill in
 forms, and sign with a drawn, typed or pictured signature kept in your
 keyring. Save a signed copy writes a new file and leaves the original as
 it was. Nothing is sent anywhere: no accounts and no tracking.
